libtriton-jit (0.1.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build against the system libfmt-dev (>= 8.1.1) instead of vendoring
    fmt via FetchContent (upstream relaxed the fmt floor to 8.1.1)
  * Drop the bundled fmt files from libtriton-jit-nvidia-dev and replace
    Conflicts: libfmt-dev with a Depends on it
  * Build against the system nlohmann-json3-dev (>= 3.10.5) instead of
    downloading json via FetchContent (upstream relaxed the floor)

 -- The FlagOS Contributors <contact@flagos.io>  Sun, 19 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0800

